 title: "I am Elvin",
 text: "I am Elvin. I have a job. I go to it in a car. My boss is a good man. He says: \"Elvin, do this.\" I do it. I do it well. She is my friend. We go to work at the same time. They say we are good. I have a book. It is for you. Can you see it? If you want it, you can have it. This is my day. I go, I do, I get, I come back. Not all of it is good. But it is my life, and I like it.",
